filofant is an open source email archive and indexing server with a
customizable webinterface like a web search engine. It creates a fulltext
index out of all archived emails and of documents stored at network shares
or ftp servers. This knowledge pool is accessible based on different
permissions by all members of a workgroup or company.

Homepage: http://www.filofant.org
Online test at: http://watch.filofant.org

Release 1.1.5:

Bugfixes/Minor enhancements
A new binary for resolving system variables  
without password query changes access to system  
settings in scripts for cronjobs. This allows a  
tighter security setting for the database. 
 
Internal references in html previews will now  
be translated correctly to the filofant preview  
page link. 
 
A bug regarding the embedding of images in html  
previews is fixed. 
 
When using the fulltext search engine with more 
than one stopword, only the first was detected 
by the filofant. This bug is fixed, too. 


